<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM earnings estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM earnings estimates cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday analyst Dan Mandresh had cut his first quarter estimate for International Business Machines Carp's earnings per share (EPS) to $2.32 from $2.56.</p>
<p>-- He also reduced his estimate for IBM's 1997 EPS to $12.50 from $13.</p>
<p>-- Mandresh cited the outlook for foreign currencies for the estimate cuts.  He kept his ratings for the company of near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 144-3/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
